rs.md">Replay the ladder</a></p></details></td></tr><tr class="look-check"><td><code class="look-path">posts/old/x.md</code></td><td><code class="look-path">page.date</code></td><td>undated</td><td>by default</td><td><strong><span class="look-glyph" aria-hidden="true">!</span>check</strong></td><td><details><summary>Show why</summary><p>Chosen by default.</p><p>To pin it: <code class="look-path">ink pin posts/old/x.md page.date</code></p><p><a href="/ada-notes/understood/why?code=page.date&amp;on=posts/old/x.md">Replay the ladder</a></p></details></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="look-table" role="region" aria-label="Files" tabindex="0"><table><caption>Files</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">About</th><th scope="col">Decision</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">From</th><th scope="col">Check</th><th scope="col">Why</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code class="look-path">LICENSE</code></td><td><code class="look-path">file.ignore</code></td><td>ignored</td><td>because LICENSE is there</td><td>ok</td><td><details><summary>Show why</summary><p>Chosen because LICENSE is there.</p><p>To pin it: <code class="look-path">ink pin LICENSE file.ignore</code></p><p><a href="/ada-notes/understood/why?code=file.ignore&amp;on=LICENSE">Replay the ladder</a></p></details></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="look-table" role="region" aria-label="The site" tabindex="0"><table><caption>The site</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">About</th><th scope="col">Decision</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">From</th><th scope="col">Check</th><th scope="col">Why</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code class="look-path">the site</code></td><td><code class="look-path">site.home</code></td><td>README.md</td><td>pinned in ink.toml, bytes 10..20</td><td>ok</td><td><details><summary>Show why</summary><p>Chosen pinned in ink.toml, bytes 10..20.</p><p>To pin it: <code class="look-path">ink pin site.home</code></p><p><a href="/ada-notes/understood/why?code=site.home">